@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title CastMeIfYouCan — odgovornosti autentifikacije
class Error <<JavaScript>>
class AuthError {
  +status : number
  +code : string
  +message : string
  +constructor(status, code, message)
}
class AuthRoutes <<module>> {
  +createAuthRouter(options) : Router
}
class Validation <<module>> {
  +validateProfile(body, now) : Profile
}
class UserModel <<factory result>> {
  +findById(id) : Promise
  +findByAuthId(authId) : Promise
  +register(identity, profile) : Promise
}
class Passport <<library>> {
  +serializeUser(callback)
  +deserializeUser(callback)
  +authenticate(strategy, options, callback)
}
class Pool <<pg library>> {
  +query(sql, values) : Promise
  +connect() : Promise
}
class Middleware <<module>> {
  +requireAuth(req, res, next)
  +requireRole(...roles) : function
  +protectMutation(config) : function
}
Error <|-- AuthError
AuthRoutes ..> Validation : validates profile
AuthRoutes --> UserModel : register / findByAuthId
AuthRoutes --> Passport : Google authentication
AuthRoutes ..> Middleware : Origin / CSRF
Validation ..> AuthError : throws
Middleware ..> AuthError : rejects request
UserModel ..> AuthError : maps uniqueness conflict
UserModel --> Pool : parameterized SQL / transaction
Passport --> UserModel : deserialize local user ID
note bottom of UserModel
  Object returned by createUserModel(pool).
  This is not an ORM entity or a JS class.
end note
note bottom of AuthRoutes
  Modules are represented as UML classifiers.
  Router options: config, passport, users, authLimiter.
end note
@enduml
